      <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>

      <p>This is a personal website. I don&rsquo;t sell anything, run ads, or ask you to sign up for anything, so I collect as little as I can.</p>

      <h3>Analytics</h3>

      <p>I use <a href="https://umami.is/">Umami</a> to see how many people visit and which parts of the site they look at. I host it myself, so the data goes to my own server and nobody else&rsquo;s.</p>

      <p>Umami doesn&rsquo;t use cookies and doesn&rsquo;t collect anything that identifies you personally. It records things like the page you viewed, the site that referred you, your browser, operating system, device type and country. Your IP address is used to work out the country and is not stored.</p>

      <h3>Hosting</h3>

      <p>The site is hosted by <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/">Netlify</a>, who may keep standard server logs (including IP addresses) to run and secure their service.</p>

      <h3>Fonts</h3>

      <p>Fonts are loaded from <a href="https://bunny.net/gdpr/">Bunny Fonts</a>, which doesn&rsquo;t log your IP address or use cookies.</p>

